    refactor(complexity): PYCMP-AI-PLAYS-POKE — decompose high-complexity functions in src/core (C901/PLR0912/PLR0915 64→29)
    
    Pure structural refactors, zero behavior change:
    
    - entity.py (7→0): extract _boss_type_bonus, _party_move_types,
      _covered_types, _critical_type_gaps, _counter_defensive_score,
      _counter_offensive_score, _apply_matchup_adjustments, _level_delta_priority,
      _suggest_bench_replacements
    - obs_patch.py (5→0): split parse_obs_patch into per-section _parse_* helpers;
      extract _validate_moved/_validate_blocked from validate_patch
    - ram_reader.py (7→0): _decode_char table-driven text decode;
      _render_grid_cell/_cell_symbol/_object_tag from render_tile_grid;
      _fill_*_observation dispatch from observe
    - state_window.py (6→0): decompose run() into _maybe_auto_advance,
      _apply_auto_advance, _obtain_tool_call, _maybe_handle_query_global,
      _maybe_handle_memory_tool (+_handle_memory_keys_tool/_handle_memory_get),
      _execute_tool_step, _post_battle_action_wait, _settled_outcome,
      _finalize_outcome; _build_keyboard_section/_add_next_letter_lines;
      _render_battle_template; _map_vision_to_hsm_state via _HSM_VISION_STATES
      table and _hsm_menu_state
    - combat.py (4→0): _effectiveness_multiplier, _accuracy_factor,
      _priority_factor, _setup_factor from score_move; _can_ko_opponent,
      _would_be_koed from should_switch
    - navigation.py (4→0): _edge_traversable/_hm_usable/_ledge_passable from
      get_neighbors; _terrain_cost_multiplier + edge-cost helpers from
      _astar_search/_calculate_movement_cost
    - goap.py, global_context.py (2→0): _precondition_met; _party_summaries
    
